{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"a5d3ccabfa0f8bed5102772a50332552477ea3ff7aacbbf05fc5163d35e4cfd7"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:3710f4bd2f1a5eacde83152f7a541a12eb2c07d47558dc52150d29b98da71ebe","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"Her close support network of loved ones","evidence":"[D12:1 | 1:50 pm on 17 August, 2023] Caroline: Hey Mel! How're ya doin'? Recently, I had a not-so-great experience on a hike. I ran into a group of religious conservatives who said something that really upset me. It made me think how much work we still have to do for LGBTQ rights. It's been so helpful to have people around me who accept and support me, so I know I'll be ok!\n[D3:11 | 7:55 pm on 9 June, 2023] Caroline: Thanks, Mel! My friends, family and mentors are my rocks – they motivate me and give me the strength to push on. Here's a pic from when we met up last week!","itemId":"urn:uuid:263a57d7-588d-5a12-ac51-5bce6423511d","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:375039282e64ee8a8bfe89e242189c7d4d4281e4f77a96642e52ec9682b48e09","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Who supports Caroline when she has a negative experience?","referenceAnswer":"Her mentors, family, and friends","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"375039282e64ee8a8bfe89e242189c7d4d4281e4f77a96642e52ec9682b48e09"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}